OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 22 DEC
OL,4,G0504FFrom Our Own Correspondent
OL,5,     GRussia has tried to capture the
OL,6,     Gcity of Pokrovsk for nearly two
OL,7,     Gyears but Ukraine has continued
OL,8,     Gto resist its advance, helped by
OL,9,     Gthe country's innovative arms
OL,10,     Gindustry.
OL,11,G0534FShipping Forecast
OL,12,G0543FPrayer for the Day
OL,13,     GSpiritual reflection to start the
OL,14,     Gday with Fiona Stewart, a writer
OL,15,     Gwho runs a Christian arts charity.
OL,16,G0545FFarming Today
OL,17,     GCould this year's Boxing Day hunt
OL,18,     Gmeets be the last in their
OL,19,     Gcurrent form, with Government
OL,20,     Gplans to ban trail hunting in
OL,21,     GEngland and Wales? We hear from
OL,22,     Gboth sides of the debate.
